velopment, Platforms, and Others; Platforms; and Others segments. The company also provides value engineering, consultancy, development and technology services; and consultancy, development and technology services. In addition, the company engages in advanced dtechnology development, and projects advisory and related engineering works; development of software and information technology related services; research, maintenance, implementation, and other information technology activities; and buying, selling, renting, and operating of self-owned or leased real estate. Additionally, it provides e-branding, e-marketing, and e-referral solutions; value engineering apps and solution for construction; and acts as a sales agent for financial institution to market and sell bank products. The company was formerly known as Golsta Synergy Berhad and changed its name to HCK Capital Group Berhad in June 2014. The company was incorporated in 1999 and is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"HCK Capital Group Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚提供房地产开发、投资、租赁、管理、销售和贸易服务。公司前身为 Golsta Synergy Berhad，于2014年6月更名为现名，成立于1999年，总部位于马来西亚八打灵再也。公司运营分为房地产开发、平台及其他三个部门。","lines":["房地产开发：从事房地产开发、投资、租赁、管理、销售和贸易服务，客户为购房者和投资者。","平台服务：提供价值工程、咨询、开发和技术服务，以及电子品牌、电子营销和电子推荐解决方案，客户包括建筑行业和金融机构。","其他业务：涉及先进技术开发、项目咨询和工程工作、软件和信息技术服务、自有或租赁房地产的买卖和运营，以及作为金融机构的销售代理营销银行产品。"],"lines_en":["Property Development: Engages in property development, investment, letting, management, sale, and trading services for homebuyers and investors.","Platforms: Provides value engineering, consultancy, development, and technology services, as well as e-branding, e-marketing, and e-referral solutions for construction and financial institutions.","Others: Involves advanced technology development, project advisory and engineering works, software and IT services, real estate buying/selling/renting/operating, and acting as a sales agent for financial institutions."]}}